{"seq":2,"slug":"abc-xyz-classification","title":"ABC-XYZ 价值×波动分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/inventory-health-metric/abc-xyz-classification","wordCount":1807,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"abc-xyz-价值-波动分类\">ABC-XYZ 价值×波动分类</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存管理资源永远是稀缺的：盘点人力、预测算力、采购跟单时间、库位面积都有限。ABC-XYZ 是分配这些资源的两轴地图——<strong>ABC 用金额回答「值不值得管」，XYZ 用波动回答「能不能靠预测管」</strong>。只做 ABC 会把「高价值但需求随机」的货当成可预测品去补，只做 XYZ 会把「波动大但不值钱」的货过度监控。</p>\n<p>ABC 的理论基础是帕累托分布。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ABC_analysis\">ABC analysis</a> 的表述，这是「an inventory categorisation technique」，「The ABC concept is based on Pareto&#39;s law」，其核心判断是「&#39;A&#39; items will typically account for a large proportion of the overall value, but a small percentage of the number of items」。该来源同时强调「there are no fixed thresholds for each class」——20/70、30/25、50/5 只是常见起点，不是准则。</p>\n<p>XYZ 这一轴用的是<strong>变异系数</strong>。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coefficient_of_variation\">Coefficient of variation</a> 的定义，它是「a standardized measure of dispersion of a probability distribution or frequency distribution」，且「the actual value of the CV is independent of the unit in which the measurement has been taken」——正因为它无量纲，才能把不同单价、不同量纲的 SKU 放到同一把尺子上比波动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[SKU 全集] --&gt; B[按年消耗金额降序排]&#10;  B --&gt; C[累计占比切分]&#10;  C --&gt; D[A 类&lt;br/&gt;约 70-80% 价值]&#10;  C --&gt; E[B 类&lt;br/&gt;约 15-25% 价值]&#10;  C --&gt; F[C 类&lt;br/&gt;约 5-10% 价值]&#10;  A --&gt; G[按需求 CV 切分]&#10;  G --&gt; H[X 类&lt;br/&gt;CV 低 稳定]&#10;  G --&gt; I[Y 类&lt;br/&gt;CV 中 季节性]&#10;  G --&gt; J[Z 类&lt;br/&gt;CV 高 随机/间歇]&#10;  D --&gt; K[AX/AY/AZ 九宫格]&#10;  E --&gt; K&#10;  F --&gt; K&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[SKU 全集] --&gt; B[按年消耗金额降序排]\n  B --&gt; C[累计占比切分]\n  C --&gt; D[A 类&lt;br/&gt;约 70-80% 价值]\n  C --&gt; E[B 类&lt;br/&gt;约 15-25% 价值]\n  C --&gt; F[C 类&lt;br/&gt;约 5-10% 价值]\n  A --&gt; G[按需求 CV 切分]\n  G --&gt; H[X 类&lt;br/&gt;CV 低 稳定]\n  G --&gt; I[Y 类&lt;br/&gt;CV 中 季节性]\n  G --&gt; J[Z 类&lt;br/&gt;CV 高 随机/间歇]\n  D --&gt; K[AX/AY/AZ 九宫格]\n  E --&gt; K\n  F --&gt; K\n  H --&gt; K\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>价值</th>\n<th>波动</th>\n<th>补货策略</th>\n<th>盘点频率</th>\n<th>预测方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AX</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>自动补货，紧公差</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n<td>移动平均/指数平滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AY</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>人工复核 + 安全库存加厚</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n<td>季节性分解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AZ</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>小批量高频、按单采购</td>\n<td>双周</td>\n<td>需外部信号，慎用纯时序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BX</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>自动补货</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>指数平滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BY</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>人工复核</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>季节性分解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BZ</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>按单/寄售</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>慎备货，转 VMI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CX</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大批量低频率</td>\n<td>半年</td>\n<td>简单均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CY</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>区间补货</td>\n<td>半年</td>\n<td>简单均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CZ</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>长尾，考虑淘汰</td>\n<td>半年</td>\n<td>不预测，按需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"abc-分层的工程实现\">ABC 分层的工程实现</h2><h3 id=\"排名法而非固定阈值\">排名法而非固定阈值</h3><p>不能写死「单价 &gt; 100 就是 A」。正确做法是按累计金额占比切分：排序后取累计占比首次越过 80% 的位置作为 A 的上界，80%–95% 为 B，其余为 C。这样分层结果会随品类结构自动漂移，不需要手工维护阈值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层的粒度与稳定性\">分层的粒度与稳定性</h3><p>分层粒度要选<strong>能承载决策的层级</strong>：补货决策在 SKU×仓，营销决策在 SKU×渠道，采购谈判在供应商×品类。同一批 SKU 在不同粒度下会落到不同类，这是正常的——但必须显式声明每个报表用的是哪个粒度。</p>\n<p>分层稳定性是另一个隐蔽问题。SKU 的 ABC 归属每季度都会因促销、清仓、新品而跳动，如果采购策略硬绑定到 ABC 类，某个 SKU 从 A 跌到 B 时策略会突然切换，造成订单断层。工程上应给分层加<strong>滞后与缓冲带</strong>（hysteresis）：升类立即生效，降类需连续两个周期确认。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH sku_value AS (&#10;  SELECT sku_id,&#10;         SUM(rolling_90d_qty * unit_cost) AS annualized_value&#10;  FROM sku_demand_90d&#10;  GROUP BY sku_id&#10;),&#10;ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT sku_id, annualized_value,&#10;         SUM(annualized_value) OVER (ORDER BY annualized_value DESC&#10;             ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW)&#10;           / SUM(annualized_value) OVER () AS cum_share,&#10;         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY annualized_value DESC) AS rn,&#10;         COUNT(*) OVER () AS n&#10;  FROM sku_value&#10;)&#10;SELECT sku_id,&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN cum_share - annualized_value / SUM(annualized_value) OVER () &lt; 0.80 THEN &#39;A&#39;&#10;    WHEN cum_share - annualized_value / SUM(annualized_value) OVER () &lt; 0.95 THEN &#39;B&#39;&#10;    ELSE &#39;C&#39;&#10;  END AS abc_class,&#10;  ROUND(cum_share, 4) AS cum_value_share,&#10;  ROUND(rn * 1.0 / n, 4) AS item_share&#10;FROM ranked;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rolling_90d_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annualized_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_demand_90d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, annualized_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(annualized_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annualized_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(annualized_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_share,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annualized_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annualized_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(annualized_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annualized_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(annualized_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'C'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abc_class,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cum_share, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cum_value_share,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_share</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>cum_share - annualized_value / SUM(...)</code> 这一项：它算的是<strong>该 SKU 之前</strong>的累计占比，避免把跨越阈值的那个 SKU 整块归错类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cv-计算与-xyz-切分\">CV 计算与 XYZ 切分</h2><h3 id=\"cv-的三个陷阱\">CV 的三个陷阱</h3><p>按上文来源的说明，CV 只在「ratio-scale measurements with a true zero」上有意义，且「dividing by a mean near zero makes it sensitive and potentially misleading」。落到库存场景有三个具体陷阱：</p>\n<p><strong>零均值爆炸。</strong> 间歇需求的 SKU 有大量零出库周，均值接近 0，CV 会算成 5、10 甚至无穷，被误判为「极不稳定」。解法是设定最小分母下限，或对均值低于阈值的 SKU 改用<strong>间歇需求专用指标</strong>（如 ADI 平均需求间隔 + CV²，即 Syntetos-Boylan 分类）。</p>\n<p><strong>零值占比。</strong> CV 只看一阶矩与二阶矩，看不出「一半周期为零」这种结构。出库序列 <code>[0,0,0,0,100,0,0,0]</code> 与 <code>[12,13,11,12,13,12,11,12]</code> 的 CV 可能相近，但前者需要按单采购、后者可以自动补货。</p>\n<p><strong>季节性伪装成高波动。</strong> 玩具类 SKU 的年度 CV 很高，但每年 11–12 月都有峰值，其实是可预测的。对这类应做<strong>季节调整后的 CV</strong>：先按季节因子去除季节成分，再用残差算 CV。</p>\n<h3 id=\"切分阈值\">切分阈值</h3><p>XYZ 的边界同样应服务于决策：X 类（CV &lt; 0.5）可以放心用统计预测驱动自动补货；Y 类（0.5 ≤ CV &lt; 1.0）需要人工复核预测；Z 类（CV ≥ 1.0）不应依赖时序预测，应转向按单、寄售或 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">供应商协同</a> 的 VMI 模式。这些阈值要随品类调整，且必须在文档里写明来源与适用范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"九宫格策略与安全库存的衔接\">九宫格策略与安全库存的衔接</h2><p>九宫格的真正价值在于把 <strong>CV 直接喂进安全库存公式</strong>。安全库存的标准形式见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_stock\">Safety stock</a>：「SS = zα × √(E(L)σD² + (E(D))²σL²)」，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是服务水平的正态分位数（该来源给出「zα = 1.65 for 95% service level」），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是需求标准差——而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>CV</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_D = \\text{CV} \\times E(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。于是 XYZ 分类不再是标签，而是安全库存的直接输入：Z 类 SKU 的 CV 大，即使需求均值相同，安全库存也显著更高，九宫格于是自动解释了「为什么 AZ 象限的库存金额总是压不下去」。</p>\n<p>同样的逻辑接到服务水平选择上：安全库存的服务水平不该一刀切 95%。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newsvendor_model\">Newsvendor model</a> 的临界分位公式，最优服务水平是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(q^{*})={\\frac {p-c}{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3355em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8544em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」，即缺货损失与毛利结构决定服务水平。AZ 象限毛利高的应给更高服务水平，CZ 象限毛利薄的应主动降服务水平换取库存下降。这层计算在 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">安全库存/超储/缺货并存诊断</a> 里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分类的漂移与重算节奏\">分类的漂移与重算节奏</h2><p>ABC 与 XYZ 的重算节奏不同：ABC 按季度（金额结构变化慢），XYZ 按月度（需求波动变化快）。两者分开重算带来一个工程要求——<strong>分类结果必须带版本号与生效时间</strong>，任何历史报表都要能还原「当时用的哪一版分类」。否则复盘时会发现同一个 SKU 在两次月报里被归入不同象限，而没人能解释原因。</p>\n<p>重算还要处理<strong>冷启动</strong>：新品没有 90 天历史，CV 无意义。新品应走独立的观察期通道（如上市 8 周内不参与 XYZ 分层，按品类先验值给临时分类），否则新品会因为样本不足被随机扔进 Z 类，触发不必要的保守策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ABC 用年消耗金额累计占比切分（80/95 为常见界），XYZ 用变异系数切分，两轴正交构成九宫格。</li>\n<li>分层阈值必须来自排名法而非硬编码单价，并加滞后缓冲带防止策略抖动。</li>\n<li>CV 对零均值和间歇需求会失真，需设分母下限或改用 ADI + CV² 分类。</li>\n<li>安全库存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>CV</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_D = \\text{CV} \\cdot E(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，XYZ 于是直接决定安全库存基数。</li>\n<li>服务水平应由 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">Newsvendor</a> 临界分位决定，不搞一刀切。</li>\n<li>分类结果带版本与生效时间，ABC 季度重算、XYZ 月度重算，新品走独立观察期。</li>\n<li>九宫格是 <a href=\"health-score-redyellow-green\">库存健康度评分</a> 的输入之一，也是资源分配的骨架。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ABC-XYZ 价值×波动分类","id":"abc-xyz-价值-波动分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ABC 分层的工程实现","id":"abc-分层的工程实现"},{"level":3,"text":"排名法而非固定阈值","id":"排名法而非固定阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"分层的粒度与稳定性","id":"分层的粒度与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"CV 计算与 XYZ 切分","id":"cv-计算与-xyz-切分"},{"level":3,"text":"CV 的三个陷阱","id":"cv-的三个陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"切分阈值","id":"切分阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"九宫格策略与安全库存的衔接","id":"九宫格策略与安全库存的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"分类的漂移与重算节奏","id":"分类的漂移与重算节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库龄分布与周转天数 DIO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/inventory-health-metric/age-bucket-dio-turnover"},"next":{"title":"库存健康度评分与红黄绿灯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/inventory-health-metric/health-score-redyellow-green"}}